  T("1962", "Konstantin Frank in the Finger Lakes", "Dr. Konstantin Frank releases his first vinifera wines from Keuka Lake, showing that Riesling and other European varieties can survive eastern winters when grafted.", 42.4736, -77.1841),
  T("24 May 1976", "Judgment of Paris", "In Steven Spurrier's blind tasting in Paris, Stag's Leap Wine Cellars 1973 Cabernet and Chateau Montelena 1973 Chardonnay beat top Bordeaux and Burgundy; Time's George Taber reports it.", 38.3993, -122.3255),
